  "description_text": "Rectangular Double-Sided Foam Tape – Strong, Reliable Adhesion for Precision Assembly. This rectangular double-sided foam tape is a practical solution for assembling 3D printed models, DIY projects, and everyday adhesive needs. Designed for strong bonding, it securely attaches components to a variety of surfaces while offering a light cushioning effect to minimize vibrations. Whether you’re working with metal, plastic, wood, or other materials, this tape provides consistent performance to meet your assembly demands. Easy to cut and apply, this tape simplifies your workflow and ensures a clean, professional finish. Ideal for hobbyists, makers, and professionals alike.\n\nLong-lasting and strong\n\nReady-to-peel cut-to-size\n\nEasy to bend and adjust shape\n\nSuitable for fitting right angled edges without leaving any gaps\n\nAdheres to a wide range of surfaces such as wood, glass, plastic, metal, etc.",
